.* root directory of this project.
.*
.* QUIWRKAUT: an IFS object's authorities. WRKAUT lists them with the
.* options that change them (a blank first entry takes option 1);
.* DSPAUT shows them. VIEW 0 shows the object authorities, VIEW 1
.* (F11) the data authorities one by one.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=PATHCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=AUTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=BITCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=VIEWCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=OBJ CLASS=PATHCL.
:VAR NAME=OBJTYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OWNER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PGP CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='*NONE'.
:VAR NAME=AUTL CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='*NONE'.
:VAR NAME=VIEW CLASS=VIEWCL VALUE='0'.
:VAR NAME=USER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=DTAAUT CLASS=AUTCL.
:VAR NAME=EXIST CLASS=BITCL.
:VAR NAME=MGT CLASS=BITCL.
:VAR NAME=ALTER CLASS=BITCL.
:VAR NAME=REF CLASS=BITCL.
:VAR NAME=OPR CLASS=BITCL.
:VAR NAME=READ CLASS=BITCL.
:VAR NAME=ADD CLASS=BITCL.
:VAR NAME=UPD CLASS=BITCL.
:VAR NAME=DLT CLASS=BITCL.
:VAR NAME=EXE CLASS=BITCL.
:COND NAME=OBJVIEW EXPR='&VIEW. EQ "0"'.
:COND NAME=DTAVIEW EXPR='&VIEW. EQ "1"'.
:LISTDEF NAME=AUTS VARS='OPT USER DTAAUT EXIST MGT ALTER REF OPR READ ADD UPD DLT EXE'.
:KEYL NAME=WRKKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=OBJVIEW.F11=Display detail data authorities
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=DTAVIEW.F11=Display object authorities
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F24 ACTION=MOREKEYS.F24=More keys
:KEYI KEY=F22 ACTION='RETURN 22'.F22=Display entire field
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=DSPKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=OBJVIEW.F11=Display detail data authorities
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=DTAVIEW.F11=Display object authorities
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F22 ACTION='RETURN 22'.F22=Display entire field
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKAUT KEYL=WRKKEYS HELP=WRKAUTH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SPACE.Work with Authority
:DATA DEPTH=6.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAC.Object . . . . . . . . . . . . :   &OBJ.
:DATAC.Type . . . . . . . . . . . . . :   &OBJTYPE.
:DATAC.Owner  . . . . . . . . . . . . :   &OWNER.
:DATAC.Primary group  . . . . . . . . :   &PGP.
:DATAC.Authorization list . . . . . . :   &AUTL.
:DATAC.
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=AUTS VIEWS=2 SCROLL=YES.
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='RETURN 0'.1=Add user
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='RETURN 0'.2=Change user authority
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='RETURN 0'.4=Remove user
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.User
:LISTCOL VAR=DTAAUT USAGE=OUTPUT.Data Authority
:LISTGRP COL=OBJAUTS.--Object Authorities--
:LISTCOL VAR=EXIST USAGE=OUTPUT.Exist
:LISTCOL VAR=MGT USAGE=OUTPUT.Mgt
:LISTCOL VAR=ALTER USAGE=OUTPUT.Alter
:LISTCOL VAR=REF USAGE=OUTPUT.Ref
:ELISTGRP.
:LISTGRP COL=DTAAUTS.--Data Authorities--
:LISTCOL VAR=OPR USAGE=OUTPUT.Opr
:LISTCOL VAR=READ USAGE=OUTPUT.Read
:LISTCOL VAR=ADD USAGE=OUTPUT.Add
:LISTCOL VAR=UPD USAGE=OUTPUT.Upd
:LISTCOL VAR=DLT USAGE=OUTPUT.Dlt
:LISTCOL VAR=EXE USAGE=OUTPUT.Exe
:ELISTGRP.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT USER DTAAUT OBJAUTS'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT USER DTAAUT DTAAUTS'.
:ELIST.
:CMDLINE SIZE=SHORT.Parameters or command
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPAUT KEYL=DSPKEYS HELP=DSPAUTH ENTER=EXIT TOPSEP=SPACE.Display Authority
:DATA DEPTH=6.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAC.Object . . . . . . . . . . . . :   &OBJ.
:DATAC.Type . . . . . . . . . . . . . :   &OBJTYPE.
:DATAC.Owner  . . . . . . . . . . . . :   &OWNER.
:DATAC.Primary group  . . . . . . . . :   &PGP.
:DATAC.Authorization list . . . . . . :   &AUTL.
:DATAC.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=AUTS VIEWS=2 SCROLL=YES.
:LISTCOL VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.User
:LISTCOL VAR=DTAAUT USAGE=OUTPUT.Data Authority
:LISTGRP COL=OBJAUTS.--Object Authorities--
:LISTCOL VAR=EXIST USAGE=OUTPUT.Exist
:LISTCOL VAR=MGT USAGE=OUTPUT.Mgt
:LISTCOL VAR=ALTER USAGE=OUTPUT.Alter
:LISTCOL VAR=REF USAGE=OUTPUT.Ref
:ELISTGRP.
:LISTGRP COL=DTAAUTS.--Data Authorities--
:LISTCOL VAR=OPR USAGE=OUTPUT.Opr
:LISTCOL VAR=READ USAGE=OUTPUT.Read
:LISTCOL VAR=ADD USAGE=OUTPUT.Add
:LISTCOL VAR=UPD USAGE=OUTPUT.Upd
:LISTCOL VAR=DLT USAGE=OUTPUT.Dlt
:LISTCOL VAR=EXE USAGE=OUTPUT.Exe
:ELISTGRP.
:LISTVIEW COLS='USER DTAAUT OBJAUTS'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='USER DTAAUT DTAAUTS'.
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKAUTH.Work with Authority - Help
:P.Who may use the object and how: the public, the owner, the primary
group and each user given a private authority. Option 1 on the blank
first entry adds a user, 2 changes a user's authority, 4 removes it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPAUTH.Display Authority - Help
:P.Who may use the object and how: the public, the owner, the primary
group and each user given a private authority.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 leaves the display, F12 goes back one display, F11 switches
between the object and the data authorities.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
